		{"id":"5ddcf2e2794dc910","type":"text","text":"Each of the [[Mural]] walls tiles have an 8 pixel encoding within them. It at first glance appears to be [[ASCII Table]] characters, but it does not spell anything obvious, so I'm currently at a dead end","x":-170,"y":-320,"width":250,"height":260},
