		{"id":"edc0ee04ca9d53ab","type":"text","text":"It is possible that the core lore of the game follows the history of the 8 deadly sins becoming 7 with Pride and Vainglory combining together as [[Lord Add]] and [[Lord Eus]] supposedly did.","x":-1213,"y":-250,"width":250,"height":290,"color":"3"},
